  },
  {
    "id": 2010015020040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんは全然悪くないです、\r\nこちらこそすみません……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001502/2010015020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015020050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "よくわかりましたね……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001502/2010015020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？\r\nそりゃあわかる……と思うんだが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015020060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あれ、そうですか……！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001502/2010015020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015020070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "自分のCDを買いに来たので、\r\n気持ち隠密行動のつもりだったんですが……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001502/2010015020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015020080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "これは失敗ですね……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001502/2010015020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、なるほど！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに髪型とかいつもと違うもんな……！\r\nメガネも似合ってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015020090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あはは、ありがとうございます！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001502/2010015020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "CD──は、買えたみたいだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015020100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい！\r\n発売日投稿、バッチリできる予定です",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001502/2010015020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "了解だ、ありがとう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015020110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "これから現場とかですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001502/2010015020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああいや、ここのお店に挨拶しようと思ってて──\r\nいつも２８３のコーナーを立派に作ってくださってるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015020120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "！　見ました！\r\nポップとかもすごく丁寧で可愛くて、嬉しいなって──！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001502/2010015020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなんだよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015020130,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "よろしければ私からの感謝もぜひ……！\r\nお伝えください……！",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001502/2010015020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん\r\n──時間が大丈夫だったら、一緒に行くか？　挨拶",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015020140,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "！\r\nいいんですか？",
